{"ref":"BDB, נַעֲמָן²","hw":"נַעֲמָן²","html":"II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נַעֲמָן</span></big><sub>16</sub>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Benj. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:21\" href=\"/Genesis.46.21\">Gn 46:21</a>, 𝔊 Νοεμ(μ)αν; = grandson of Benj. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:40\" href=\"/Numbers.26.40\">Nu 26:40</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, 𝔊 Νοεμα(νει), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.4\">1 Ch 8:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.7\">7</a> (so 𝔊 <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:21\" href=\"/Genesis.46.21\">Gn 46:21</a>), 𝔊 in Ch Νοομα, 𝔊L Ναμει, Νααμαν.<br><strong>2.</strong>  Aramaean general <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.1\">2 K 5:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.6\">6</a> + 8 times <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5\" href=\"/II_Kings.5\">2 K 5</a>; 𝔊 Ναιμαν, 𝔊L Νεεμαν.","next":"BDB, נַעֲמִי²","prev":"BDB, נַעֲמָן"}